/-! Proof of the frozen
`Paper16AccessibilityMilestoneFreshApplicationTargetsV2.FreshApplicationFromLeast`
(Fable B, 27 November 2026).

The fresh report is opened by `exact_OpenParsedFresh` into the six parsed coordinates of the
arrow address and the packed free address. Both addresses then carry literal address reports
(`exact_OriginalLiteralAddressReport`, transported along the shell equations), K1 gives the
second scalar acceptance, K2 gives the least representative of the application seed, and
`exact_OpenLiteralApplicationFromReportedLeast` rebuilds the accepted application at the emitted
result address. The stored type of the result is its literal result field, equal to the
codomain code by functionality of the codomain projection. -/

